# Retrieval index: commit the lightweight data (corpus/qrels/questions/meta) so it's usable
# without a rebuild; ignore the heavy, re-embeddable binaries and the raw negative pool
# (its text already lives in corpus.jsonl). Regenerate binaries with
# scripts/indexing/build_retrieval_index.py; refresh negatives with extract_negatives_v_runs.py.
data/retrieval_index/_negatives_raw/
data/retrieval_index/**/index.faiss
data/retrieval_index/**/embeddings.npy
data/retrieval_index/**/bm25.pkl
